            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Jonas, Hans. <em>The Gnostic Religion: The Message of the Alien God and the Beginnings of Christianity</em>. 2nd ed. Boston: Beacon Press, 1963.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Koester, Helmut, Bentley Layton, Thomas O. Lambdin, and Harold W. Attridge. “The Gospel According to Thomas.” In <em>Nag Hammadi Codex II, 2-7</em>, edited by Bentley Layton. Leiden: E. J. Brill, 1989.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Meyer, Marvin. <em>The Gospel of Thomas: The Hidden Sayings of Jesus</em>. San Francisco: HarperCollins, 1992.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Pagels, Elaine. <em>The Gnostic Gospels</em>. New York: Random House, 1979.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Pagels, Elaine. <em>Beyond Belief: The Secret Gospel of Thomas</em>. New York: Random House, 2003.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 10px;">Robinson, James M., ed. <em>The Nag Hammadi Library in English</em>. 3rd ed. San Francisco: HarperSanFrancisco, 1988.</li>
          </ul>

        </div>

